# Privacy Policy

**Spy Chess: Genesis**
**Last updated: May 25, 2026**

This Privacy Policy describes how **Spy Chess: Genesis** ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and shares information when you use our mobile application ("App"). By using the App you agree to the practices described below.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

### 1.1 Information You Provide
- **Account registration** — When you create an account via email/password, Google Sign-In, or Apple Sign-In we collect your display name, email address, and profile photo.
- **Profile updates** — Any changes you make to your username or profile picture.
- **Guest (anonymous) play** — If you choose to play as a guest, we generate a temporary anonymous account. No name or email is required.

### 1.2 Information Collected Automatically

| Category | Details |
|---|---|
| **Device information** | Device model, operating system version, and unique device identifiers (collected via `device_info_plus`). |
| **Push notification token** | FCM (Firebase Cloud Messaging) token used to send game invites and chat notifications. |
| **Gameplay data** | Game history, moves, spy selections, chess ratings, win/loss records, and game results, stored in Firebase Firestore. |
| **Chat messages** | In-game and friend chat messages stored in Firebase Firestore. Messages are visible to the participants of each conversation. |
| **Online status** | Real-time online/offline status and last-seen timestamp visible to friends and matched opponents. |
| **App preferences** | Theme preference and other local settings stored on-device via `shared_preferences`. |
| **Crash and diagnostics** | Crash reports and performance data collected by Firebase Crashlytics and Firebase Analytics to improve app stability. |
| **Advertising data** | If you have not subscribed to Spy Chess Pro, Google Mobile Ads may collect advertising identifiers and usage data to serve personalised or non-personalised advertisements. We use a UMP (User Messaging Platform) consent flow to obtain your consent where required by law. |
| **Purchase data** | Subscription status and purchase history managed through RevenueCat. We do not store full payment card details. |

### 1.3 Information from Third Parties
- **Google Sign-In** — If you sign in with Google, we receive your Google account name, email address, and profile picture as permitted by your Google account settings.
- **Apple Sign-In** — If you sign in with Apple, we receive the information Apple shares with us (which may include a relayed email address) as permitted by your Apple ID settings.
- **Firebase services** — Authentication, Firestore database, Cloud Storage (profile images), Crashlytics, and Cloud Messaging are provided by Google Firebase. Firebase may collect diagnostic and performance data independently under [Google's Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy).

---

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use the information we collect to:

- Create and manage your account.
- Enable multiplayer games, friend requests, and in-game chat.
- Send push notifications for game invites, chat messages, and game events (you can disable these in your device settings).
- Calculate and display your chess rating.
- Show your online status to friends and matched opponents.
- Serve advertisements to non-subscriber users (subject to your consent where required by law).
- Process and verify in-app subscription purchases.
- Investigate and respond to reports of cheating, harassment, and other rule violations.
- Improve app stability and fix bugs using crash and diagnostic data.
- Comply with legal obligations.

---

## 3. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR / UK GDPR)

If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom, we process your personal data on the following lawful bases:

| Processing Activity | Lawful Basis |
|---|---|
| Creating and managing your account | **Performance of a contract** — necessary to provide the App services you request. |
| Enabling multiplayer, chat, and friends | **Performance of a contract** — core features of the App. |
| Calculating and displaying ratings | **Performance of a contract** / **Legitimate interests** — providing a fair competitive environment. |
| Sending push notifications | **Consent** — you may withdraw consent at any time in your device settings. |
| Serving personalised advertisements | **Consent** — obtained via the in-app UMP consent flow. |
| Serving non-personalised advertisements | **Legitimate interests** — funding the free tier of the App. |
| Crash and diagnostic data | **Legitimate interests** — improving app stability and user experience. |
| Processing subscription purchases | **Performance of a contract** — verifying and fulfilling your purchase. |
| Complying with legal obligations | **Legal obligation**. |

Where we rely on legitimate interests, we have balanced those interests against your privacy rights and do not use your data in a way that overrides those rights.

